1
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:45,000
{\an8}DIADAPTASI DARI NOVEL
<i>HIDDEN LOVE</i> OLEH ZHU YI

2
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:51,560 
- Aku sungguh heran.
- Tunggu.

3
00:01:52,880 --> 00:01:54,840 
- Kau ke mana saat itu?
- Aku makan dulu.

4
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:56,600 
Apa-apaan?

5
00:01:58,120 --> 00:02:01,240 
Kita bertiga sedang bermain,
aku mendapat panggilan telepon.

6
00:02:01,320 --> 00:02:02,320 
Kau bahkan memarahiku.

7
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:04,760 
- Saat kita hampir menang itu?
- Ya, itu.

8
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:07,960 
Sudah kubilang, 'kan?

9
00:02:08,039 --> 00:02:09,080 
Dia lagi?

10
00:02:09,639 --> 00:02:12,760 
Saat itu, hari Valentine hampir tiba.
Aku membelikannya bunga mawar.

11
00:02:14,160 --> 00:02:15,520 
Norak sekali.

12
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:18,080 
Apa noraknya membeli bunga?

13
00:02:18,720 --> 00:02:20,360 
Kuno, sangat norak.

14
00:02:20,440 --> 00:02:22,280 
Kau tidak akan ada harapan, aku serius.

15
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:24,680 
- Sudah, makanlah.
- Kau tidak mengerti.

16
00:02:24,760 --> 00:02:25,960 
Bunga banyak juga percuma.

17
00:02:26,040 --> 00:02:27,400 
- Dengarkan.
- Bunga apa?

18
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:29,560 
- Kau saja tidak tahu.
- Itu sangat norak.

19
00:02:29,640 --> 00:02:31,960 
Dia memberikan mawar merah.

20
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:33,520 
Kau masih tidak ingat?

21
00:02:33,600 --> 00:02:35,320 
Bisa lebih perhatian sendikit?

22
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:37,440 
Asal tahu saja.
Dia mengunggahnya di Weibo.

23
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:41,240 
Katanya, "Andai ada yang memberiku
mawar merah segar di hari Valentine."

24
00:02:41,320 --> 00:02:42,720 
Kuberi suka di postingan itu,

25
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:45,200 
lalu, aku langsung turun
membelikannya mawar merah.

26
00:02:49,920 --> 00:02:51,160 
Aku makan terlalu banyak.

27
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:53,480 
Kita pesan terlalu banyak.

28
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:55,280 
Sebelum kau datang, kami sudah pesan.

29
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:57,320 
<i>Dia bersikap begitu…</i>

30
00:02:59,040 --> 00:03:01,120 
<i>karena tidak mau
aku merasa canggung, 'kan?</i>

31
00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:04,600 
Salah satu meminta nomormu,
satu lagi meminta nomormu juga.

32
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:07,440 
Tidak ada yang minta nomorku,
aku cadangan kalian, 'kan?

33
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:10,120 
Coba jadi Sang Yan.
Bukankah jadi diri sendiri lebih baik?

34
00:03:10,600 --> 00:03:11,960 
Jadi Duan Jiaxu juga boleh.

35
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:14,480 
Baik, aku akan ambil mobil.

36
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:16,320 
Kalian berdua tunggu aku di depan.

37
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:17,960 
Kau ikut mereka.

38
00:03:18,760 --> 00:03:19,840 
- Cepat, ya.
- Ayo.

39
00:03:21,920 --> 00:03:23,320 
Sang Zhi.

40
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,960 
Mau capit boneka, 'kan? Kutemani.

41
00:03:25,040 --> 00:03:26,040 
Ayo main capit boneka.

42
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:27,320 
Qian Fei, tidak usah.

43
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:29,320 
Tidak apa-apa,
aku sudah janji padamu, ayo.

44
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:31,560 
Aku paling mahir main ini, kuajari nanti.

45
00:03:38,720 --> 00:03:39,640 
Sang Zhi.

46
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:40,960 
Ayo ambil.

47
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:42,880 
Terima kasih.

48
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:43,800 
Ambil.

49
00:03:45,640 --> 00:03:46,520 
Sudah cukup.

50
00:03:46,600 --> 00:03:48,360 
Ayo, kuajari satu per satu.

51
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:18,000 
Sini, biar kubantu.

52
00:04:51,200 --> 00:04:52,080 
Yang putih ini?

53
00:05:09,320 --> 00:05:10,280 
Dua koin lagi.

54
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:32,040 
Aku sudah mengambilkanmu boneka.

55
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:33,240 
Jangan menangis lagi.

56
00:05:39,320 --> 00:05:41,480 
<i>Kau sudah bekerja keras. Kutraktir permen.</i>

57
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:45,240 
Bagaimana?

58
00:05:45,320 --> 00:05:46,640 
Tadi nyaliku besar tidak?

59
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:49,800 
Terima kasih, Jiaxu.

60
00:05:49,880 --> 00:05:51,400 
Ayo, kuantar pulang.

61
00:05:51,880 --> 00:05:53,800 
Sekalian menasihatimu di jalan.

62
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:55,760 
Tunggu sebentar.

63
00:05:56,400 --> 00:05:58,560 
Saat kakakku mewakili orang tuaku,

64
00:05:58,640 --> 00:06:00,280 
dia tidak menasihatiku lagi.

65
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:02,280 
- Benarkah?
- Benar.

66
00:06:03,880 --> 00:06:05,440 
Biar kutanya kakakmu langsung.

67
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:08,280 
Jangan! Tunggu!
Jika kau tanya, bukankah dia akan tahu?

68
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:10,280 
Jika dia tahu,
sia-sia kau datang hari ini.

69
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:11,640 
Bocah.

70
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:14,080 
Kau memintaku datang jauh-jauh.

71
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:15,760 
Jika sekarang kau membohongiku,

72
00:06:15,840 --> 00:06:17,240 
aku akan sangat dirugikan.

73
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:26,480 
Trik ini lagi?

74
00:06:32,840 --> 00:06:34,200 
Baiklah, aku tidak bilang.

75
00:06:35,880 --> 00:06:36,920 
Dasar bocah.

76
00:06:39,520 --> 00:06:40,720 
Kalau begitu, aku pergi.

77
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:43,360 
Mau ke mana?

78
00:06:43,960 --> 00:06:45,920 
Sekarang sudah sore.

79
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:48,120 
Jika belum pulang,
ibuku akan mencemaskanku.

80
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,200 
Kuantar pulang.

81
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:52,120 
Tunggu sebentar!

82
00:06:52,200 --> 00:06:54,040 
Halte bus dekat.

83
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:56,640 
Selain itu, setelah turun bus,
bisa jalan kaki.

84
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:59,040 
Sekarang kau pasti sangat sibuk, 'kan?

85
00:07:00,120 --> 00:07:01,960 
Aku sudah mengganggumu cukup lama.

86
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:04,040 
Kau pergi bekerja saja.

87
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:05,800 
Aku tidak tahu kau begitu perhatian.

88
00:07:06,440 --> 00:07:08,520 
Sesibuk apa pun,
aku harus mengantarmu pulang.

89
00:07:30,840 --> 00:07:31,680 
Jalan lebih cepat.

90
00:07:38,200 --> 00:07:41,320 
Jiaxu, hari sudah sore,
kau masih belum kembali ke kampus?

91
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:44,280 
Tenang saja, Bocah.

92
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:46,440 
Akan kubantu merahasiakan kejadian ini.

93
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:47,800 
Benarkah?

94
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:49,600 
Janji kelingking?

95
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:56,360 
Kau juga harus janji dulu.

96
00:07:56,440 --> 00:07:58,200 
Perhatikan pelajaran di kelas.

97
00:07:58,280 --> 00:07:59,600 
Jangan melanggar tata tertib.

98
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:01,040 
- Setuju?
- Setuju.

99
00:08:03,320 --> 00:08:04,560 
Aku tidak bercanda.

100
00:08:05,080 --> 00:08:07,640 
Jika orang tuamu dipanggil lagi,

101
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:09,680 
kejadian hari ini akan ketahuan.

102
00:08:09,760 --> 00:08:10,720 
Aku bisa celaka.

103
00:08:11,280 --> 00:08:12,520 
Kau bisa datang lagi.

104
00:08:13,440 --> 00:08:14,480 
Masih mau ulangi?

105
00:08:15,320 --> 00:08:16,520 
Bukan.

106
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:18,680 
Aku hanya merasa kau baik padaku.

107
00:08:18,760 --> 00:08:20,480 
Lebih dari kakakku.

108
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:21,440 
Jadi…

109
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:25,120 
jika kelak aku mengalami
masalah lagi seperti ini,

110
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:28,280 
bisakah memintamu lagi
menyamar menjadi kakakku?

111
00:08:35,559 --> 00:08:36,440 
Aku mengerti.

112
00:08:38,559 --> 00:08:39,679 
Ayo pulang.

113
00:08:41,280 --> 00:08:42,840 
Masih saja berpikir mengulanginya.

114
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:49,720 
Ini.

115
00:08:50,760 --> 00:08:51,600 
Hampir lupa.

116
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:54,880 
Lampu di dapur rumahmu rusak.

117
00:08:55,520 --> 00:08:57,880 
Setelah pulang, berikan ini pada ayahmu.

118
00:08:57,960 --> 00:08:59,920 
Baik, terima kasih, Jiaxu.

119
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:01,240 
Tidak masalah.

120
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:02,200 
Cepatlah pulang.

121
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:07,800 
- Jiaxu, sampai jumpa.
- Patuhi ucapanku.

122
00:09:08,880 --> 00:09:10,160 
Sampai jumpa.

123
00:09:54,600 --> 00:09:55,640 
Bocah yang aneh.

124
00:09:58,480 --> 00:09:59,760 
Ayo pergi.

125
00:10:27,880 --> 00:10:29,480 
Kenapa kau membohongiku lagi?

126
00:10:30,040 --> 00:10:32,000 
Aku enggan pergi, sungguh.

127
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:33,840 
Kita sudah di sini, ayo pergi bersama.

128
00:10:33,920 --> 00:10:35,440 
Aku juga sudah membeli kado.

129
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:38,000 
Benar, aku tidak membeli kado.

130
00:10:38,080 --> 00:10:40,240 
Tidak apa, bilang saja
kita membelinya bersama.

131
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:41,720 
Apa sulitnya? Ayolah.

132
00:10:42,680 --> 00:10:46,000 
Sebaiknya bilang kau membelinya sendiri.
Aku tidak akrab dengannya.

133
00:10:46,880 --> 00:10:49,160 
Tidak apa, kita pergi bersama saja.

134
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:51,240 
Aku sudah janji bertemu di sini.

135
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:53,880 
Selamat datang.

136
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:02,000 
Sang Zhi?

137
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:05,240 
Jiaxu.

138
00:11:05,320 --> 00:11:06,560 
Kau bermain dengan teman?

139
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:08,080 
Halo.

140
00:11:08,160 --> 00:11:09,040 
Halo.

141
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:11,320 
Apakah kau bekerja di sini?

142
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:15,360 
Ayo.

143
00:11:15,440 --> 00:11:16,640 
Lihatlah ingin makan apa,

144
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:17,760 
nanti pesan di sini.

145
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:19,200 
Cari kursi dan duduk dulu.

146
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:26,240 
Dia tampan sekali.

147
00:11:26,920 --> 00:11:27,920 
Siapa dia?

148
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:29,760 
Seingatku wajah kakakmu bukan itu.

149
00:11:30,760 --> 00:11:32,040 
Temannya kakakku.

150
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:33,400 
Temannya kakakmu?

151
00:11:37,760 --> 00:11:38,600 
Dia tampan.

152
00:11:38,680 --> 00:11:40,080 
Kakakmu juga tampan.

153
00:11:40,160 --> 00:11:41,760 
Sang Zhi, kau sungguh bahagia.

154
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:43,280 
Kau lihatlah ingin makan apa.

155
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:47,760 
Aku ingin makan…

156
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:51,240 
Puding susu…

157
00:11:52,520 --> 00:11:53,920 
Kacang merah atau mangga saja.

158
00:11:55,520 --> 00:11:57,400 
Lebih baik aku

159
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:59,200 
makan puding susu kacang merah saja.

160
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:05,280 
Puding susu Saigon,
aku tidak bisa makan yang ini.

161
00:12:05,760 --> 00:12:08,480 
Kalau begitu, lebih baik
puding susu kacang merah saja.

162
00:12:09,200 --> 00:12:11,480 
Aku pesan puding susu kacang merah,
coba kau lihat.

163
00:12:12,640 --> 00:12:13,800 
Kalau begitu, aku mau…

164
00:12:14,880 --> 00:12:16,200 
Sagu mutiara santan.

165
00:12:16,280 --> 00:12:18,040 
- Tidak ada lagi?
- Tidak.

166
00:12:18,560 --> 00:12:19,920 
Kalau begitu, aku pesan dulu.

167
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:21,200 
Tolong jaga ponselku.

168
00:12:21,280 --> 00:12:22,160 
Baik.

169
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:28,320 
Ingin makan apa?

170
00:12:28,400 --> 00:12:29,520 
Aku mau

171
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:31,360 
puding susu kacang merah

172
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:33,160 
dan sagu mutiara santan.

173
00:12:33,240 --> 00:12:35,440 
Baik, kau pesan yang mana?

174
00:12:36,080 --> 00:12:37,360 
Sagu mutiara santan.

175
00:12:48,880 --> 00:12:50,200 
Masih kurang satu yuan.

176
00:12:52,880 --> 00:12:53,880 
Tidak kurang.

177
00:12:55,200 --> 00:12:56,680 
Kau melirikku berkali-kali.

178
00:12:57,360 --> 00:12:59,160 
Jika melirikku secara gratis, aku rugi.

179
00:13:03,400 --> 00:13:05,400 
Pantas di tempat kerjamu
tidak ada pelanggan.

180
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:07,200 
Karena kau membuka toko ilegal.

181
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:10,920 
Minta satu yuan lebih saja
langsung menjadi toko ilegal?

182
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:12,600 
Aku juga tidak melirikmu.

183
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:16,240 
Baik, aku yang sembarangan bicara.

184
00:13:17,560 --> 00:13:19,440 
Kau kira aku akan sungguh meminta uangmu?

185
00:13:19,520 --> 00:13:21,440 
Kau simpan saja untuk membeli permen.

186
00:13:21,520 --> 00:13:22,640 
Tidak bisa seperti itu.

187
00:13:22,720 --> 00:13:24,640 
Kau bekerja untuk mencari uang, 'kan?

188
00:13:24,720 --> 00:13:27,240 
Jika aku tidak membayarmu,
bagaimana kau dapat uang?

189
00:13:29,720 --> 00:13:30,800 
Ambil kembali uangmu.

190
00:13:31,400 --> 00:13:33,760 
Mentraktirmu makanan manis
tidak akan membuatku rugi.

191
00:13:34,360 --> 00:13:35,440 
Temanmu menunggu.

192
00:13:52,600 --> 00:13:56,360 
Sang Zhi, apakah teman kakakmu ini
mau mentraktir kita?

193
00:13:58,760 --> 00:14:00,200 
- Ya.
- Bagus sekali.

194
00:14:00,280 --> 00:14:02,080 
Kebetulan usai beli kado, uangku kurang.

195
00:14:04,240 --> 00:14:05,320 
Biar kutanya mereka.

196
00:14:06,560 --> 00:14:08,080 
Sudah sampai di mana?

197
00:14:12,200 --> 00:14:14,520 
Kalian di mana?
Kami sudah menunggumu sangat lama.

198
00:14:17,280 --> 00:14:19,200 
Fu Zhengchu, cepatlah datang.

199
00:14:19,880 --> 00:14:20,720 
Silakan.

200
00:14:22,480 --> 00:14:23,640 
Puding susu pesananmu.

201
00:14:25,120 --> 00:14:25,960 
Terima kasih.

202
00:14:28,080 --> 00:14:29,000 
Terima kasih, Jiaxu.

203
00:14:29,080 --> 00:14:30,120 
Pesananmu masih panas.

204
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:34,960 
Cicipi.

205
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:40,080 
Aromanya sangat harum.

206
00:14:41,880 --> 00:14:43,080 
Kau mau mencicipi punyaku?

207
00:14:44,280 --> 00:14:45,160 
Duan Jiaxu.

208
00:14:45,240 --> 00:14:46,160 
Pak Gao.

209
00:14:47,080 --> 00:14:49,000 
Aku harus buru-buru pergi ke toko kedua.

210
00:14:49,080 --> 00:14:49,920 
Lalu,

211
00:14:50,400 --> 00:14:53,600 
soal gajimu yang mau dibayar di muka,
kubayarkan setengah bulan dulu.

212
00:14:54,400 --> 00:14:56,200 
- Terima kasih, Pak Gao.
- Kembalilah bekerja.

213
00:14:56,280 --> 00:14:58,160 
- Aku akan mengurusnya.
- Ya.

214
00:15:07,040 --> 00:15:08,600 
<i>Apakah dia kekurangan uang…</i>

215
00:15:09,840 --> 00:15:11,680 
<i>makanya selalu bekerja?</i>

216
00:15:16,440 --> 00:15:17,280 
Fu Zhengchu!

217
00:15:17,360 --> 00:15:19,160 
- Sang Zhi, maaf aku terlambat.
- Halo.

218
00:15:21,520 --> 00:15:22,720 
Halo!

219
00:15:23,800 --> 00:15:24,720 
Halo.

220
00:15:29,200 --> 00:15:30,480 
Sang Zhi,

221
00:15:30,560 --> 00:15:31,720 
kakakmu bekerja di sini?

222
00:15:33,960 --> 00:15:35,600 
Bukankah keluarga kalian kaya raya?

223
00:15:37,960 --> 00:15:39,480 
Bisakah jangan ikut campur?

224
00:15:44,760 --> 00:15:45,640 
Hampir sore,

225
00:15:45,720 --> 00:15:46,720 
ayo pergi bermain.

226
00:15:47,600 --> 00:15:48,520 
Ayo.

227
00:15:48,600 --> 00:15:49,800 
Makananku belum habis.

228
00:15:50,440 --> 00:15:51,720 
Jangan makan lagi, Sang Zhi,

229
00:15:51,800 --> 00:15:52,920 
ayo kita segera pergi.

230
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:54,480 
Semua orang menunggu kita.

231
00:15:54,560 --> 00:15:55,880 
Makanan apa pun ada.

232
00:15:55,960 --> 00:15:56,880 
Ayo.

233
00:15:59,120 --> 00:16:00,000 
Sang Sang, ayo.

234
00:16:00,080 --> 00:16:00,960 
Semua sudah diatur?

